OL,3,GNEWSAFilm buff brings town's cinema    
OL,4,Aback to life after eight years         
OL,6,FIt is quite a step up for the whisky   
OL,7,Fdistiller - originally from Coleraine -
OL,8,Fwhose only previous experience was a   
OL,9,F"trial run" with converting his garage 
OL,10,Finto a home cinema.                    
